OL,3,GNEWSAMasked youths smashed cars in
OL,4,A'mindless vandalism'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gang of masked youths smashed up cars
OL,7,Fin a supermarket car park and in a
OL,8,Fnearby residential street in "an
OL,9,Fappalling act of criminal damage",
OL,10,Fpolice have said.
OL,12,FAbout 20 people are said to have
OL,13,Ftargeted vehicles in the Asda car park
OL,14,Fand in Hey Road in Huyton, Merseyside,
OL,15,Fat about 20:00 GMT on Friday.
OL,17,FA CCTV video shared on social media
OL,18,Fshows more than a dozen males dressed
OL,19,Fin black, with some stamping through
OL,20,Fthe windows of parked cars.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
