OL,3,GNEWSAMasked youths smashed cars in
OL,4,A'mindless vandalism'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This was an appalling act of criminal
OL,7,Fdamage that will not be tolerated,"
OL,8,Fsaid Insp David Hassett of Merseyside
OL,9,FPolice. "We are under no illusion how
OL,10,Fthis mindless vandalism can have a
OL,11,Fsignificant impact on the owners of
OL,12,Fthese vehicles."
